    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nFor Sale by Public Auction - Unless previously sold.\nDate - Thursday 22nd October at 12noon\nLocation - Both online and in person at our office, 1 Westgate, Wexford, Y35RR77\nSolicitor for Carriage - Nigel D Allen, 3 Slaney Street, Wexford\n\nPositioned on the ever-popular and highly sought-after St. John's Road, we are delighted to present 'Cammarano', a charming detached three-bedroom residence set on a spacious garden, just a short stroll from Wexford's vibrant Main Street.\n\nThis unique property offers an ideal opportunity for those looking to downsize without compromising on space, character, or location. Combining the convenience of manageable living with the comfort of a detached home, Cammarano is perfectly suited to a range of buyers.\n\nWhile the property would benefit from some modernisation, it has recently been externally wrapped to enhance insulation and improve energy efficiency, providing an excellent foundation for its next owners to create a wonderful home in one of Wexford's most desirable residential settings.\n\n99 sqm, detached bungalow, mains services."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 5.1m x 1m\nwith laminate flooring, glazed panels either side of the front door\n\nDining/Living Room - 5m x 3.4m\nwith open fire (with back boiler), laminate flooring, front facing window, hot press\n\nKitchen - 3.3m x 2.5m\nwith linoleum flooring, waist level units, rear door and window\n\nRear Lobby - 2.5m x 0.9m\nwith timber flooring and skylight\n\nBedroom 1 - 4m x 2.6m\nwith carpet flooring\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.9m x 2.5m\nwith carpet flooring and side facing window\n\nBathroom - 3.1m x 1.7m\nwith linoleum flooring, WC, WHB and bath\n\nStudy - 3.9m x 2.1m\n(measurement at widest point) with laminate flooring\n\nBedroom 3 - 4m x 2.9m\nwith timber flooring, open fire in tiled surround, WHB\n\nSitting Room - 4.9m x 3.4m\ndouble aspect room with timber flooring, picture rail and open fire\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Location Location Location</li><li>Kitchen, dining and living area to one side</li><li>Well proportioned sitting room to the other end of the house</li><li>3 bedroom, 1 bathroom detached bungalow</li><li>OFCH and back boiler, side gate access</li><li>Rear yard with small shed</ul>"
      },
